  ["Hybrid","Free Live Hybrid Course","Free","₹15,999",true,"/faq-gmat-free-course/","/faq-gmat-free-course/","Enroll Free",["250+ Hours Course Cycle","Audio, Video & Chat Interaction","Live In-class Doubt Solving","Personalized Learning Experience"]],
